            },
            "reviewBody": "This is way better than store bought. I cut the recipe in half to keep it from getting stale but other than that it is made as written. If I changed anything I would have to call it my recipe so if you are going to add to it than don't rate it. I am going to freeze some to see if it stays fresh.",
